      "number": 20,
      "question": "Statement: Should schemes of voluntary retirement be introduced in all sick public sector units in India? Arguments: I. Yes excess and inefficient staff is one of the reasons of sickness of public sector organizations though they are experienced. II. Yes, this is what private and multinational companies do in the developed countries.",
      "questionHtml": "<p>Statement: Should schemes of voluntary retirement be introduced in all sick public sector units in India?</p><p>Arguments:</p><p>I. Yes excess and inefficient staff is one of the reasons of sickness of public sector organizations though they are experienced.</p><p>II. Yes, this is what private and multinational companies do in the developed countries.</p>",
      "options": [
